# fuel-alloc-minimums: `ticker` loads with Fuel per Run and the Allocation
# Budget at their conformance minimums, 1000000000 and 268435456, which every
# Core must honour. Running a Run out of a billion Fuel isn't tractable, so
# this case shows the values accepted, at load and as a Delivery's override
# equal to them, with a small Run inside them. The exhaustion points
# themselves are pinned at small limits in fuel-exhaustion-point and
# alloc-exhaustion-point.
#
# An override may only tighten. One past the Script's limit, by 1, loosens
# it, so the Host call is refused at the call with `invalid value`: it gets
# no delivery id and changes nothing. Refused inputs are written at the call,
# and accepted Deliveries when the Pump drains them, so the refused ones come
# first here, as a Core writes them.
#
# The last Delivery tightens Fuel to 10. `tick` is dispatch 4, const 1,
# store 1, load-var 1, load 1, then `add` (4) at ticker:8, source 6:3, which
# would make 12, so it faults having spent 8. `ticks` isn't written yet, so
# there is no rollback. The first Run's 17 Fuel is exact too.
# At its end, ticks counts 16 and d2 is still a 32-byte mailbox message,
# so state is 48. After d2 faults the mailbox is empty and state is 16.

> load ticker identity=9a3714f918324088ca393462700269d9c1863404991f5daa0079141aab080eb8

> deliver to=ticker message=tick limits={fuelPerRun: 1000000001}
refused code="invalid value"
> deliver to=ticker message=tick limits={allocPerRun: 268435457}
refused code="invalid value"

> deliver d1 to=ticker message=tick limits={fuelPerRun: 1000000000, allocPerRun: 268435456}
> deliver d2 to=ticker message=tick limits={fuelPerRun: 10}
> pump clock=2026-09-28T09:00:00Z
seg ticker/r1 start delivery=d1 handler=tick clause=1 fuel=17 alloc=16 state=48 end=return
run ticker/r1 outcome=completed delivery=d1 handler=tick fuel=17 alloc=16
fault ticker/r2 limit=fuel at=ticker:8 pos=6:3
seg ticker/r2 start delivery=d2 handler=tick clause=1 fuel=8 alloc=0 state=16 end=fault
run ticker/r2 outcome=limit-fault delivery=d2 handler=tick limit=fuel fuel=8 alloc=0
pumped state=idle fuel=25

> vars
vars ticker ticks=1
